</span>

<figcaption class="os-caption-container">
  <span class="os-title-label">Figure </span>
<span class="os-number">16.5</span>



  <span class="os-divider"> </span>
  <span class="os-caption">When two sets of rays from common points on an object are reflected by a flat mirror into the eye of an observer, the reflected rays seem to originate from behind the mirror, which determines the position 